# What must not reach a deployment.
#
# Without this, `vercel deploy` from this directory uploads the whole folder and
# serves it — which would have put the internal release record at
# /RELEASE.md on a public Preview URL, alongside the test suite and the
# end-to-end harness. None of it is a web asset.
#
# Only index.html, app.css and js/ are the application.

RELEASE.md
README.md
tests/
e2e/
node_modules/
package.json
package-lock.json
